  "html": "<p>108級學長第一次企業參訪大成功!</p>\n<p><img alt=\"109.03.27 研華智慧園區參訪\" height=\"380\" src=\"/legacy/img/2512d387de-919797624.png\" width=\"650\"></p>\n<p>本次參訪由工程學院 邱建國 副院長帶隊前往研華物聯網園區前往聆聽專題演講與園區導覽。</p>\n<p>專題演講-研華台灣區營運處 林其鋒 副總</p>\n<p>講題『物聯網與工業4.0的發展趨勢 』</p>\n<p>防疫期間作好防疫措施，平安參訪也收穫滿滿!</p>\n<p>更多參訪照片請查看<u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/EMRDofNTUST/photos/?tab=album&amp;album_id=2511001349213451&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARD2zavqB3iijtQa_DCmlBLXEX5Kcg-nxRNRMRBjmCenY8O1bTMMojmR2L7wrGRT8u9CRUL8xuEcsV_TkygEHth0YLLgXIgmIT2w15QUga4k7FVqHsDBRNd_2J2NDPqWJf2wlIx0fCpyyFX5qIw5B_txeP-Oay1wuNN10EjSkIch70ADVsFOsBNbWD1RJ5b9EXl7EBTno8vBj-zsbCuzIlwlQbDaMmPSUaPTQd6sn0eZOZsXah3JB7CSJu_i49eMZdib8bvuEvBZN65LhI2H19HIJpemqVSw1v8Es_Pjvxp7c70d2xiuPGQU8gtTn9UWKa7OX8P0wDmIZ4LM9rY_ndn1c55S-FIrKGnUKW0dMzxFRP7MHPO-PG0Ca0cqoPIlk3-KLjpaWJB63c5TDveZ0sZ2s7rsj7ZYv0NBP7cvuD51a68N8OI6twxn8RQhxEy9E9jRzMOusiIE4VvYUcOsOOn3Ww&amp;__tn__=-UC-R\" title=\"photo\">FB粉絲專頁相簿</a></u></p>",
